<title>NEW ZEALAND: Fernz shareholders adopt minority veto.</title>
<headline>Fernz shareholders adopt minority veto.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fernz Corp Ltd shareholders voted on Thursday in favour of a special resolution where the company adopts minority veto takeover provisions.</p>
<p>There were 23.4 million votes in favour of the resolution from members of the public and 2.6 million against, while 50.8 million non-public votes were also in favour.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
